# Chandelier ring (one-way, Stage 9): a flat k-outlined Y/o brass band
# (top 5 px, the walking surface over the full width) with crystal
# drops w/s and small Y/o bulbs hanging below on k hangers (nothing
# upright); the ring ends curl down (W/E ends). A 3-wide run is one
# chandelier; its chains are in bg_zauner_salon.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_luster
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
